### Product question: do macros exist?

| Surface | Fact |
|---------|------|
| EBNF / GBNF / tree-sitter | **no** `macro` production |
| `oodac/*.oo` `macro_expand` / `ast_macro` | **only** `check_residual.oo` L28–29 |
| Expand helper (`fn macro_expand`, AST splice) | **absent** |
| `load_expand` / `collect_expand` | **import graph**, not AST rewrite |
| C `#define` in emit | compiler-internal (max-cycles / asserts), not `.oo` macros |
| DESIGN / PM 1.4 | names refused; real macros later |

